11.2s] step 1   got hubspot__closed_won (7 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 11.2s] step 1   got hubspot__search (8 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 11.2s] step 2   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 14.5s] step 2   got read hubspot.search in full (\u2588\u2588 rows) (8 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 14.5s] step 2   got read hubspot.search in full (\u2588\u2588 rows) (8 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 14.5s] step 3   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 17.7s] step 3   calling slack__search_messages query='win rate pipeline'\r\n  [ 17.7s] step 3   calling slack__search_messages query='closed lost deals'\r\n  [ 29.8s] step 3   ! slack__search_messages failed: UpstreamError: slack: timeout calling GET /search.messages\r\n  [ 29.8s] step 3   ! slack__search_messages failed: UpstreamError: slack: timeout calling GET /search.messages\r\n  [ 29.8s] step 4   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 48.0s]          drafting the report from 8 observation(s)\r\n  [ 61.3s]          checking every citation resolves\r\n  [ 61.3s]          re-reading each claim against its own evidence\r\n  sufficiency gate: skipped, this report asserts no cause\r\n  [ 66.7s]          writing the report\r\n\r\n==============================================================================\r\nQ: Can you check hubspot and tell me the closed won rate in the last 3 months?\r\n==============================================================================\r\n\r\nConfidence: high\r\nTook 61s over 4 steps, 50,367 tokens, 8 observations gathered, 5 cited\r\n\r\nANSWER\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  The closed-won rate over the last \u2588 months (Jul \u2588 - Sep \u2588\u2588, \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588) is \u2588.\u2588% by deal count (\u2588 won vs \u2588\u2588 lost) and \u2588.\u2588% by dollar value ($\u2588\u2588\u2588K vs $\u2588.\u2588\u2588M), down from \u2588\u2588.\u2588% by count in the prior quarter (Apr-Jun \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588).  [hubspot.closed_won 00e75113, hubspot.search 3c00875d, hubspot.search 71d40761, hubspot.closed_won c283df61, hubspot.search 6b7932c2]\r\n\r\nFINDINGS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  Closed-won rate, last \u2588 months (Jul \u2588 - Sep \u2588\u2588, \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588)  (high)\r\n    - In the last \u2588 months (Jul \u2588 - Sep \u2588\u2588, \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588), HubSpot shows \u2588 closed-won deals and \u2588\u2588 closed-lost deals, for a closed-won rate of \u2588/(\u2588+\u2588\u2588) = \u2588.\u2588% by deal count.  [hubspot.closed_won 00e75113, hubspot.search 3c00875d, hubspot.search 71d40761]\r\n    - By dollar value, closed-won totaled $\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 versus $\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 closed-lost in the same window, an \u2588.\u2588% win rate by amount.  [hubspot.closed_won 00e75113, hubspot.search 71d40761]\r\n  Prior quarter comparison (Apr \u2588 - Jun \u2588\u2588, \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588)  (high)\r\n    - The prior quarter had \u2588 closed-won deals against \u2588\u2588 closed-lost, a \u2588\u2588.\u2588% win rate by count, versus \u2588.\u2588% in the most recent quarter.  [hubspot.closed_won c283df61, hubspot.search 6b7932c2, hubspot.closed_won 00e75113, hubspot.search 71d40761]\r\n\r\nRISKS AND CAVEATS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - Slack search for context on this quarter's pipeline discussion timed out twice, so no qualitative corroboration (e.g., team commentary on lost deals) was available; the rate itself is derived directly from HubSpot deal records and does not depend on Slack.\r\n  - This measures only deals with a closedate in the window; deals still open are excluded, so this is a rate among decided deals, not a full-pipeline conversion rate.\r\n\r\nDATA QUALITY\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - Some closed-won records in the prior quarter (Apr-Jun) had null amount or null source fields, indicating incomplete data entry for older/imported deals; this did not affect the count-based rate.\r\n  - The github commits sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github deployments sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github issues sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github links sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog annotations sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog events sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n\r\nSOURCES\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  00e75113  hubspot.closed_won  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?closed_won=2026-07-01..2026-09-30\r\n  c283df61  hubspot.closed_won  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?closed_won=2026-04-01..2026-06-30\r\n  3c00875d  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?closedate=2026-07-01..2026-09-30&hs_is_closed_won=true\r\n  71d40761  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?closedate=2026-07-01..2026-09-30&hs_is_closed_lost=true\r\n  6b7932c2  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?closedate=2026-04-01..2026-06-30&hs_is_closed_lost=true\r\n\r\nphase breakdown (67s wall, 65s measured)\r\n  phase        calls  seconds  share    mean  tokens\r\n  survey           1    0.992    1%   0.992  no model call\r\n  recall           1    0.025    0%   0.025  no model call\r\n  loop_model       4     32.2   48%     8.0  in 8 out 2,580 cached 70,583\r\n  loop_tools       3   